      "title": "👑 Pixaroma - Note - START HERE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n---\n\n### Models are downloaded automatically the first time you use the workflow.\n \n---\n\n## 🧩 Nodes Installed from Manager  \n\n- ComfyUI-Easy-Use\n- Qwen3-TTS - Voice Synthesis & Cloning\n- ComfyUI_LayerStyle\n\nRead More about Qwen TTS Node [HERE](https://github.com/flybirdxx/ComfyUI-Qwen-TTS)\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources  \n🎥 **Tutorials:** [Pixaroma YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma)  \n💬 **Community Discord:** [Join Here](https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3)\n\n---\n\n## 🎙️ Qwen3 Voice Design + Save Voice Workflow\n\nGenerate speech audio from text using Qwen3-TTS, then save the designed voice for reuse.\n\n### 🧠 What It Does\n- Text → natural speech\n- Voice style comes from your **Voice Direction**\n- Saves an MP3 automatically\n- Saves the designed voice as a reusable preset (**SaveVoice**)\n\n### ✍️ How To Use\n1. **Speech Text**: type what you want spoken  \n2. **Voice Direction**: describe the voice (required for VoiceDesign)  \n   Examples: `male, 25–35, low pitch, calm, medium pace, YouTuber, close mic`  \n   More: [Voice Design Guide](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/qwen-tts-voice-design)  \n3. **Filename (SaveVoice)**: set a name like `my_custom_voice`  \n4. **Language (Qwen3-TTS)**: use **Auto** or pick a language for best accuracy  \n5. Click **Run**\n\n### 💾 Save Locations\n- MP3 preview is in **Save Audio (MP3)**\n- MP3 saves under: **ComfyUI\\\\output\\\\audio** \n- Saved voices (SaveVoice) are stored in: **ComfyUI\\\\models\\\\qwen-tts\\\\voices**"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
